entry PASS / PARK (the train's Stop wording) / FAIL (a defect the queue file itself carries: a verdict that is not 40-hex, a pull request that is not open), plus a summary line, `--json`, and a `--self-test`.\n\n## Head\n\n`a7913c6f9439cf112b09be5586ff09f8de051afe` is the orchestrator's recarry of main into the previous head. It is not a clean merge of the live head and main (HEAD has 1 parent(s), not a 2-parent merge), so prepr checked this head.\n\na7913c6f9439cf112b09be5586ff09f8de051afe\n\n## Mutation proof\n\nSelf-test arms that go red when a stop is deleted (measured at the head):\n\n- M1 — drop the row stop: `FAIL a pull request with no dev/programme/delivery/7.md row PARKs, the train's row wording`.\n- M2 — drop the bot-tip stop: `FAIL a head whose tip is a GITHUB_TOKEN push PARKs for recarry`.\n- M3 — drop the budget gate: `FAIL a budget head without the owner's review at its head PARKS, named as the raise` (and the revoked-mandate and unreadable-reviews arms with it).\n- M4 — drop the carry read: `FAIL a verdict that does not carry to the head PARKs with the carry line`.\n\n## Null control\n\nThe unmodified tree: `queue_pre_flight self-test: 28 checks, 0 failed`, whose first arm is the null control — a fully-passing queue prints all-PASS and `run_queue` reports it clean. The arms separate live: #2148 reads PARK (row) at its real head, and PASS is reachable only when every precondition holds (the stubbed null control).\n\n## Figures\n\n- `python3 tools/audit/seat/queue_pre_flight.py --self-test` — 28 checks, 0 failed.\n- `python3 tools/audit/seat/queue_pre_flight.py /Users/timmalmstrom/hpo-seats/orch-resume-1009/orch/q-ci-first.json --checkout /Users/timmalmstrom/heatpump_optimizer` — the orchestrator's live queue: `#2123 FAIL (head: #2123 is MERGED, not open)` (merged on main since its verdict), `#2143 PARK (row: #2143 has no dev/programme/delivery/2143.md in the three-dot diff)`, `#2148 PARK (row: … 2148.md …)`, `#2119 PARK (recarry: fix/r9-ux-6 is already checked out at /private/tmp/r9-fix-2119 …)`; `PRE-FLIGHT: 4 entries: 0 PASS, 3 PARK, 1 FAIL`.\n- the synthetic bad queue at `/private/tmp/r9-fix-preflight/q-bad.json` (malformed verdict, a cross-wired verdict, a real head): `FAIL (queue: …)`, `PARK (carry: … is not an ancestor …)`, `PARK (row: …)` — the carry arm ran `app_approve.sh --carry` for real.\n\n## Red checks\n\nnone locally beyond the tree's known Mac limits: `tests/structure.py` passes at the head; `tests/entities.py` cannot run on this host (3.11 raises on a nested f-string on main's own file, and the 3.14 venv has no `homeassistant` — the container-only lane); the new file sits under the `tools/audit/` INERT prefix, so no closure change is owed.\n\n## Forward-carry\n\nnone\n\n## Friction\n\nnone\n\n","created_at":"2026-10-12T15:50:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T18:47:03Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T18:47:01Z","merged_at":"2026-10-12T18:47:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"11715198073b6d7491ccf0a8af9268f5aea41c68","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/pulls/2153/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/pulls/2153/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/issues/2153/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tvofi/heatpump_optimizer/statuses/a7913c6f9439cf112b09be5586ff09f8de051afe","head":{"label":"tvofi:fix/queue-pre-flight","ref":"fix/queue-pre-flight","sha":"a7913c6f9439cf112b09be5586ff09f8de051afe","user":{"login":"tvofi","id":70032254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDMyMjU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70032254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvofi","html_url":"https://github.com/tvofi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvofi/fol